{{#section "subject"}}
A Passkey Was Added To Your Arcus Account
{{/section}}

{{#section "plaintext-body"}}
Hi {{{_person.firstName}}},

A passkey named "{{{passkeyName}}}" was added to your Arcus account,
and it can now be used to log in. If you added it, please disregard
this email.

If you did not add it, your account may have been compromised. Remove
the passkey under Settings > Profile, then change your password, which
signs you out everywhere else. If you can't log in, use Forgot Password.
{{/section}}

{{#section "html-body"}}

	{{#partial "greeting" }}
	Hi {{ _person.firstName }},
	{{/partial}}

	{{#partial "message" }}
	<p>A passkey named "{{passkeyName}}" was added to your Arcus account, and it can now be used to log in. If you added it, please disregard this email.</p>
	<p/>
	<p>If you did not add it, your account may have been compromised. Remove the passkey under Settings &gt; Profile, then change your password, which signs you out everywhere else. If you can't log in, use Forgot Password.</p>
	{{/partial}}

{{#partial "extra" }}
	{{/partial}}

{{> layout-html-email}}
{{/section}}
